(task (id "a93aee73") (title "Exports from several containers overwrite each other's history and tasks") (state "done") (priority 2) (assignee "claude") (labels "dogfood" "export" "replication") (parent "") (details "Each thread exports codebase/ from its own ~/.deus, so the last export wins: history.sexp loses the other containers' entries, and tasks.sexp reverts tasks another container changed. Needed: fullLog dedup by causal hash plus importing codebase/history.sexp before export, and a field-wise task merge on import (Tasks.merge exists for branches).") (links (change "8159bef4faeb8b17340d3c582bd348b9e7ce2b25cab06b047f754b47ddf144ef")) (comments))
